Subject: [PATCH 23/29] refactor(vfs/stats): extract writeback sync methods
 into stats_writeback
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Partial #12 (gqf2008/brewfs)

Fifth slice: move the 14 sync_writeback_* and 2 add_writeback_* methods
(~373 lines) into src/vfs/stats_writeback.rs as an extension impl, with
ORD made pub(crate) for the sibling module. Pure code motion — no
behavior change; stats tests pass.
